<BaseLayout title="Tires and wheels">
  <h1>Tires and wheels</h1>
  <p>Record the tire size, load index, speed rating, wheel dimensions, and approved pressure for the specific vehicle and wheel package.</p>
  <p>Use the tire-pressure label on the vehicle and the owner's manual for pressure guidance. Check pressures when tires are cold, and account for load and driving conditions as specified by Volvo.</p>
</BaseLayout>
